<title>GERMANY: BANKING SOURCE - NO TRUTH IN DEUTSCHE-AGF REPORT.</title>
<headline>BANKING SOURCE - NO TRUTH IN DEUTSCHE-AGF REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banking sources said on Wednesday there was no truth in a newspaper report that Deutsche Bank AG was seeking to buy French insurer AGF.</p>
<p>&quot;There's no truth in it,&quot; one source, who declined to be named, told Reuters.</p>
<p>German daily Die Welt reported in its Wednesday edition that Deutsche wanted to take over a leading French insurer and cited unnamed industry watchers as saying it was targeting AGF.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
